{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Zul'Gurub: Jin'do's totems stand at random points of the Bloodfire Pit, not on fixed spots",
  "contract": [
    "The round-8 tester asked for Jin'do's (11380) totems to stand at random places of the area they stood in, instead",
    "of on the ten trash pack spots of the Bloodfire Pit that round 7 used. A third hero visits each of the ten old spots",
    "once the Brain Wash Totems (15112) and the Powerful Healing Ward (14987) stand, and neither may stand within 0.05",
    "yards of it; a totem on a fixed spot stands at its exact point. The ten 0.05-yard discs cover 0.079 of the pit's",
    "4,899 square yards, so with three Brain Wash Totems and one ward a random placement fails this by chance less than",
    "once in 10,000 runs. The totems still stand at least 13 yards from the tank beside Jin'do: the pit's nearest corner",
    "is 15 yards away. All heroes carry the Delusions vision aura (2118511), which Delusions of Jin'do skips, so its",
    "phase aura (2118512, mask 3) cannot move a hero out of the lane's phase and away from the totems."
  ],
